<title>USA: Lukens Inc raises tool steel prices 4 pct.</title>
<headline>Lukens Inc raises tool steel prices 4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COATESVILLE, Pa. 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lukens Inc said Wednesday that it will increase the prices of all hot rolled tool steel steel grades and Finishline tool steel grades by four percent. The increase will be effective with shipments beginning April 27.</p>
<p>Lukens is a maker of specialty steel, manufacturing carbon, alloy and clad plate steels, as well as stainless steel sheets, strips and plate products.</p>
</text>
